Package: taskforest-b
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: fontconfig, libfreetype6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libvulkan1
Recommends: polkitd
Suggests: taskforest, smartmontools, nvme-cli, xfsprogs, iw, mesa-vulkan-drivers, nvidia-vulkan-icd
Maintainer: TaskForest contributors <noreply@yellowwhiteblackcat.github.io>
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Homepage: https://github.com/YellowWhiteBlackCat/TaskForest
Description: Wayland-native Bevy UI system monitor (taskforest-b)
 TaskForest-B presents live CPU, memory, disk, network, and GPU telemetry
 and provides process, service, startup application, and login-session
 controls in the Wayland-native Bevy UI frontend.
 .
 Wayland session required (X11 is not supported). Vulkan loader and a Vulkan
 ICD for your GPU are needed for wgpu rendering; the suggested packages cover
 the common cases. Privileged telemetry helpers are provided by the taskforest
 package or standalone helper installations.
